WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:36.260
<i>Say, Miss, did you catch
the episode the other day?</i>

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.890
<i>That giant-chested girl showed up
with another job for my master.</i>

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:43.010
<i>It was another one of those stupid,
"Oh, protect me!"jobs.</i>

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:46.350
<i>I naturally said no,
but my master's so dumb...</i>

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.020
<i>So now the Sunabo group
is in a real pickle!</i>

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.040
<i>Be sure to watch it, Miss!</i>

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:11.830
J-Junko?!

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:16.760
H-hey! Wait!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.250
<i>Everyone! Dinner's ready!</i>

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.200
<i>We humbly accept this!</i>

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.440
<i>Eh?! Another one?!</i>

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:31.870
<i>Yes, our sixth!</i>

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:34.910
<i>You'll just have to work even harder, Dad!</i>

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:36.460
<i>You got me there!</i>

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:42.750
I'm too late!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:01.680
Just a dream... A horrible dream...

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.780
Oh no! Junko!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.410
The moon's already that high?!

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:08.990
Shit!

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:16.650
<i>I hurt all over from sleeping so weird...</i>

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.530
Taiko! You...

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:21.350
<i>Master. You're awake.</i>

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:22.520
Hey, now!

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:27.560
What is a teenage girl thinking,
crawling into a man's sleeping bag?!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.520
Though I can understand how
you fell for my incredible charm!

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.400
<i>What're you talking about?!</i>

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:38.550
<i>I was helping you warm up after
you fainted and nearly froze to death!</i>

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.470
<i>Eww!</i>

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:45.470
<i>He smells like pee!</i>

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.560
<i>It would've been easy
enough to use my AC,</i>

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:55.120
<i>but I can't use my recon equipment
if my battery runs out!</i>

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.020
<i>That's why...</i>

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:58.520
<i>I reluctantly kept you warm!</i>

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.280
<i>I assume you're going to
chase him to get the girl back?</i>

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:15.880
You know me!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.520
Hurry! This is a
matter of utmost urgency!

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:28.880
<i>Hurry? It's already
been two hours since then.</i>

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:31.870
<i>I bet they're already...</i>

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:37.000
D-d-don't be stupid! Junko would
never let that jack-off just do her!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:44.000
<i>That's true! You couldn't do her
and you had 9 or 10 days to try!</i>

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.450
Please don't remind me.

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:51.650
B-but if he ties her up or drugs her,

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:54.120
<i>Master. Master!</i>

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:54.120
she wouldn't...

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:55.780
What?! You're annoying!

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.270
<i>T-t-three of those new suits!</i>

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:25.070
Crap! Those're Uzumaki pursuers!

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:27.310
<i>Do you suppose they overlooked us?</i>

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.890
Well, they ARE wearing
prohibited stuff too...

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.490
They probably can't afford
to cause a big hubbub...

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:36.960
<i>But if we're up against
four of those Specials...</i>

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.450
<i>What do we do?</i>

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:42.800
<i>We have practically no ammunition left!</i>

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:44.960
No choice.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.840
An enemy's an enemy.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:49.590
Kosuna!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.080
What's our exact location?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.980
Wasn't there an old mine nearby?

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:58.770
<i>Let's see... It's one hour west of here.</i>

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:01.170
Great! We're takin' a side trip!

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:18.290
<i>Don't tell me you're trying to do
something about the transmitter?</i>

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.600
<i>You could tell?</i>

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.290
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.030
<i>Is it OK to take it apart here?</i>

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.640
<i>Isn't it a sensitive device?</i>

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:31.180
<i>It's sink or swim.
As long as I have this, l...</i>

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.390
<i>I think it's too late now, though...</i>

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:37.590
<i>I guess I got carried away...</i>

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:41.790
<i>Everything before went so well,
even though it wasn't me doing it...</i>

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.280
<i>The Sunabouzu, was it?</i>

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:49.450
<i>I've never seen anyone
with such eyes before!</i>

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:53.570
<i>But I sure was scared against your first helper!</i>

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.100
<i>I was truly terrified...</i>

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.330
<i>I somehow managed thanks to the Special,</i>

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.870
<i>but the second guy was probably pretty well-known.</i>

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:06.680
<i>The third was an eastern bounty hunter,
and the fourth, an outlaw...</i>

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:09.360
<i>Every last one was useless.</i>

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:15.430
<i>How many died, do you think?</i>

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.030
<i>W-what the?!</i>

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:24.270
<i>- It's the Sunabouzu!
- What?!</i>

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.270
<i>He's finally here!</i>

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:30.490
<i>Help! Kan-chan!
He's in his underwear right now!</i>

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.950
<i>Hey! Tanigawa!</i>

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.040
<i>So you are here!</i>

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.040
<i>Did you make up with your girl?!</i>

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.550
<i>The chairman's fumin' mad!</i>

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.020
<i>Check this out, man!</i>

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:59.240
<i>What?! What's going on?! Who are they?!</i>

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:05.170
<i>P-p-pursuers from the company!</i>

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:05.750
<i>Eh?</i>

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:12.230
<i>The three D, E, and F
Type Specials!</i>

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:17.450
<i>And these voices belong to the
mercenaries who tested the Specials!</i>

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.910
<i>Hey, Seiji!</i>

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.490
<i>You got 10 minutes!</i>

00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:24.460
<i>Come out quietly and we'll spare your life!</i>

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.730
<i>You know what happens after 10 minutes!</i>

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.900
<i>We blow you into tiny pieces!</i>

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:33.010
<i>You're gonna surrender, right?!
I don't wanna die here!</i>

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:38.560
<i>Sorry! I surrender...</i>

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:42.740
<i>Even if we do surrender,
they won't let us live!</i>

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.790
<i>The fate of the company is at stake!</i>

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.790
<i>I'll draw them out.</i>

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.780
<i>You use that chance to run!</i>

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:01.830
<i>Seiji! You'd...</i>

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:05.540
<i>Don't get the wrong idea!
I'm not dying for you!</i>

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.450
<i>There's still so much I want to do!</i>

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.420
<i>I will survive!</i>

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:19.040
<i>Well, it's been 10 minutes.</i>

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:20.580
<i>Dumb bastard...</i>

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:22.500
<i>Let's do it!</i>

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:39.890
<i>There you are, C-Type!</i>

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.740
<i>He can hit from that distance?!</i>

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.290
<i>If you input the gun's abilities,</i>

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:49.250
<i>it'll automatically aim for you
depending on the target's distance!</i>

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.050
<i>That's a Special for ya!</i>

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.750
<i>Turns a spoiled amateur
into a professional killer!</i>

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:57.920
<i>There he goes!</i>

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.600
<i>What the hell?! He's just
gonna ditch the girl?!</i>

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.550
<i>Hell if I know!</i>

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.180
<i>Don't kill her! I got a
ton of stuff to ask her!</i>

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.340
<i>Asshole! I'll stop you!</i>

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:10.770
<i>- Drive him into the valley!
- I'll take the right!</i>

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.980
<i>Akaike! Kill the girl!
He's trying to let her escape!</i>

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:15.340
<i>I know!</i>

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:19.370
<i>Watch yourself! She's one hell of a fox!</i>

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.950
<i>Leave her to me!</i>

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:38.920
<i>Yo.</i>

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:42.140
<i>You got some nerve, Engineer.</i>

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.830
<i>Is she that hot of a chick?</i>

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.430
<i>Y-yeah...</i>

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:50.250
<i>I love 'em like that!</i>

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:03.120
I've been spotted!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:07.700
<i>Even when upside-down?</i>

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:10.790
<i>What?!</i>

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:13.940
<i>Bastard had help!</i>

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.110
<i>Damn! Fall back for now!</i>

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.590
<i>Huh?! They're fleeing!</i>

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:19.900
Those're some real pros.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.480
They retreated without any hesitation at all.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:26.600
When the situation gets out of hand,
the best thing to do is run away.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.060
Catch.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.320
Wouldn't you prefer that?

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:33.040
Think I'll borrow me this one.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.910
<i>What is he doing?</i>

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.850
<i>This thing is loaded...</i>

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:52.760
They're after you and Junko.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:55.120
I'm only after Junko.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:59.800
In other words, the three of them
are our common enemies.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:04.480
We can always settle our score
after we've taken care of them, right?

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:18.150
<i>Why do I have to put up with this crap?!</i>

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.330
<i>Nice ass, fox!</i>

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.590
<i>Ugh!</i>

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.000
<i>What the?</i>

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.880
<i>It's the Sunabouzu's signal!</i>

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.630
<i>How far am I supposed to run?!</i>

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.050
<i>Left?!</i>

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.760
<i>What the?! It's a dead end!</i>

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.180
<i>Checkmate, Missy.</i>

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.130
<i>What a hottie you are!</i>

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.860
<i>Don't kill me! I'll do anything you say!</i>

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.860
<i>Anything?</i>

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.700
<i>Yes! Anything at all!</i>

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:06.410
<i>A blow job, a hand job,
or even feet stuff if you want!</i>

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:08.910
<i>Even anal?</i>

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.150
<i>O-of course.</i>

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.420
<i>Sounds good!</i>

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:26.750
<i>So spare me! OK?!</i>

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.010
<i>OK?!</i>

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:30.800
<i>But I'm not good with live women.</i>

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.810
<i>He dodged it?!</i>

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.320
<i>Who the hell are you?!</i>

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:45.240
<i>Come on! Get out here!</i>

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:48.320
<i>I-I'm dead! Damn it!</i>

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:50.820
<i>Come on, come on, come on!</i>

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:00.640
Don't get carried away, moron!

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:01.710
<i>Master!</i>

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.570
The Special got away...

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:05.990
Damn!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.970
They really are flawless bastards!

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:10.250
<i>He has eyes on his back!</i>

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:13.490
<i>After I got that dumb broad to
lure him into a dead end, too!</i>

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.430
<i>Who's a dumb broad?!</i>

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:16.990
<i>Oh, you're alive.</i>

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:18.730
<i>Will you cut the crap?!</i>

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.810
<i>You'll use me as bullet protection
and bait for that moron Seiji.</i>

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.470
<i>S-Seiji?!</i>

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:28.350
Yeah, we're a team until we
take care of those Uzumaki thugs.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.780
<i>I couldn't play around anymore...</i>

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.500
<i>What the hell's going on?!</i>

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:42.730
Well, only two hours 'till sunup.
Just one last push.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.530
<i>Do you have a plan or something?</i>

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:49.510
You know I'm not the kind to take
action if there's no way to win...

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.400
<i>But how can we win in this situation?!</i>

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:54.420
<i>It's almost dawn.</i>

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.530
<i>What're you talking about?</i>

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.120
<i>Two unknown accomplices.</i>

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:18.530
<i>And we fell right into their ambush...</i>

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:20.600
<i>Can't show mercy anymore.</i>

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:26.500
<i>We'll show that Seiji bastard
just how strong his Specials really are!</i>

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:52.970
<i>Seiji. You out-and-out engineer.</i>

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.100
<i>You shoulda just jacked off
at your desk like a good boy!</i>

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.670
Damn! They're gettin'
way too trigger-happy!

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:28.110
<i>How can we possibly win this?!</i>

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.510
<i>We're done for!</i>

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:30.030
Five...

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:31.400
Four...

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:32.780
Three...

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:34.280
Two...

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.030
One...

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.240
<i>Master! It's here!</i>

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:42.750
We made it!

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:43.500
<i>Here it comes!</i>

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.300
<i>Yes!</i>

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.040
<i>Those tanks!</i>

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.950
<i>It's the government army!</i>

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.450
That's right!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:26.900
I told you we'd settle the score
after we took care of them.

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:29.590
As you can see,
they're pretty much done for.

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:32.710
<i>Damn! Where'd they come from?!</i>

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:39.480
<i>Give yourselves up.
You are completely surrounded.</i>

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.920
<i>Give yourselves up. You are completely...</i>

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:46.050
<i>Government army, my ass!</i>

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:50.920
<i>Don't tell me you called them here?!</i>

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:54.530
There's an old mine nearby that
used to be under government control.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:18:00.240
Hidden inside is a top-secret
direct hotline to the government.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:01.530
<i>Hotline?!</i>

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:07.330
Yep, a line only nice people helpful
to the government know about.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.750
<i>You squealed?! Are you a government dog?!</i>

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.530
Government dog?

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:17.050
Sure, whatever. I don't care
what you call me!

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:22.460
Just think about it.
We're enemies of a huge company now!

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:26.030
Even after this, they're just
gonna send more and more after us.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:27.770
In which case...

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.770
...the only choice is
to crush the whole company.

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:36.440
<i>C-crush the company?!</i>

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:43.710
Defeat the enemy! No matter the cost,
and as completely as possible!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.930
<i>T-the company!</i>

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:13.990
<i>Thanks to your uproar,
we're now aware of Uzumaki's wronging.</i>

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:17.730
<i>I doubt the northern
government doesn't know.</i>

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:23.610
<i>The company executives will most
likely be put to death for treason,</i>

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:28.160
<i>and the nearly 1000 employees
and their families cast into the desert.</i>

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.250
<i>A-all because of me...</i>

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.490
<i>No! The company is to blame!</i>

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.770
<i>It's because the company
tried to get rid of me!</i>

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.650
<i>Dumb man.</i>

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:54.340
<i>He rushed ahead without thinking...</i>

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.110
<i>This is why I hate naive nerds!</i>

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.710
<i>You know it's all your fault!</i>

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.960
<i>Asagiri Junko.</i>

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:03.120
<i>We'd like to ask you some things as well.</i>

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:05.220
<i>Could you accompany us?</i>

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:05.990
<i>Eh?</i>

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:10.180
<i>I hear you're doing some
interesting things up north.</i>

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.920
<i>No, I'm not going to arrest you.
I was hoping you might assist us...</i>

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.250
N-n-not so fast!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:17.210
<i>Kan-chan!</i>

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:18.080
<i>Yes?</i>

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:22.130
I still haven't gotten
paid for this woman yet!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.260
If you take off with her, I can't...

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:28.720
See?! It's an official
government contract.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.500
W-what the hell?!

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:39.110
<i>Master!</i>

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.190
<i>Quit it...</i>

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:46.760
<i>Nothing ever happened here, nor have you seen anything.</i>

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:48.230
<i>Got that?</i>

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:51.500
<i>Kan-chan!</i>

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.980
<i>Let go of me!
What're you doing to my master?!</i>

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.250
<i>Master!</i>

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:57.450
<i>Master!</i>

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.730
<i>Master!</i>

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.190
<i>Please say something!</i>

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.130
<i>Are you all right?! This is horrible!</i>

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:08.950
<i>Master!</i>

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:28.070
<i>They hauled everyone off...</i>

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:33.120
<i>What was the point of
all our hard work today?</i>

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:38.320
<i>Still, that evil-breasted lady
got what she deserved!</i>

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:40.760
<i>She deserves to suffer once in a while!</i>

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:41.820
Let's go.

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:55.310
<i>Master didn't say a single word on the way home.</i>

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:57.000
<i>Master! Wait for me!</i>

00:21:55.600 --> 00:22:02.010
<i>I couldn't help but sense something very ominous in the unusual ambience...</i>

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:07.580
<i>But to think the contract
would be torn up...</i>

00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:56.640
<i>Yo. Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here.</i>

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:57.870
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:59.180
<i>Please cheer up!</i>

00:23:59.180 --> 00:24:02.550
<i>Look, if I squeeze my arms together,
I can sort of make cleavage!</i>

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:04.510
<i>- Next episode is "Above and Below".
- Uh... Umm...</i>

00:24:04.510 --> 00:24:06.770
<i>I-I know! Miss it, and it's Maiching!</i>

00:24:06.770 --> 00:24:09.550
<i>- I'm outta here.
- M-Master! Master!</i>
